<title>USA: Great Lakes to resume three more routes.</title>
<headline>Great Lakes to resume three more routes.</headline>
<dateline>SPENCER, Iowa 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Great Lakes Aviation Ltd on Thursday said it planned to resume United Express service on Friday to Rhinelander, Wisconsin; and Manistee and Muskegon, Michigan.</p>
<p>The airline has been gradually resuming service as the Federal Aviation Administration completes inspection of its fleet after a voluntary suspension of operations May 16.</p>
<p>Great Lakes shares were down 1/16 at 7/8 Thursday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
